1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,018
Crawler Analytics
A local walkthrough of tracking, site analytics, and CSV export.

2
00:00:04,018 --> 00:00:08,802
Email and password authentication
Create an account or sign in with Supabase Auth.

3
00:00:08,802 --> 00:00:14,008
Your websites, in one place
Open a site to install its tracker and explore its activity.

4
00:00:14,008 --> 00:00:20,117
Install one lightweight, async snippet
Each website has a unique site ID for event attribution.

5
00:00:20,117 --> 00:00:29,547
Check installation from your browser
A test signal confirms delivery without adding an analytics event.

6
00:00:29,547 --> 00:00:35,020
Explore real queries over local demo data
10,000 synthetic visits are distributed across the last 30 days.

7
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:41,265
Change the reporting period
One database RPC powers the overview, charts, pages, and activity log.

8
00:00:41,265 --> 00:00:47,555
Filter by platform and bot purpose
Every dashboard section updates to the same selection.

9
00:00:47,555 --> 00:00:54,936
Compare activity across AI platforms
The platform breakdown groups visits using user-agent classification.

10
00:00:54,936 --> 00:01:02,135
Find popular pages and inspect recent requests
Ranked page counts and event details help explain the trends.

11
00:01:02,135 --> 00:01:09,130
Export all recorded events
CSV includes all dates and is independent of the dashboard filters.

12
00:01:09,130 --> 00:01:14,135
From installation to insight
Recorded locally with synthetic data. No production traffic or credentials shown.
